  "details": "Because the Face Mirror has received significant updates (such as Zoom), please consider re-evaluating the Near-Clip distance set on the Face Mirror in order to prevent issues such as this (see Screenshot attached).\n\nAs you can see, either the Near Clip is too far out, or the Transform of the Orthographic Camera is too close. This causes major clipping visible in the Face Mirror, which can be distracting.\n\nPlease change this so that I can clearly see my Feet, rather than inside of my Body/Legs.",
